 2026 brackets, and estimate your refund with worked examples.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",\\\"W-2 tax refund calculator 2026\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"W-2 tax refund calculator 2026\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",\\\"W2 refund estimator\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"W2 refund estimator\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",\\\"federal tax refund 2026\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/30 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[9px] text-muted-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"federal tax refund 2026\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1c:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"2e:I[27201,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/61cc43b3d7ad2990.js\\\"],\\\"IconMark\\\"]\\n1a:null\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1e:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment \\u0026 How to Pay | TheTaxCalc\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Complete Alameda County property tax guide 2026. Rates by city, payment schedule, exemptions, how to appeal assessments, and OBBBA SALT cap impact. Free guide.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"author\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about#rachel-mitchell\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"author\\\",\\\"content\\\