 impact. Free guide.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about#rachel-mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"alameda county property tax,property tax california,oakland property tax,alameda county tax collector,prop 13,property tax 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"category\",\"content\":\"finance\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"classification\",\"content\":\"Tax Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"11\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"google-site-verification\",\"content\":\"verify_google_site_verification_token\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment & How to Pay | TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Complete Alameda County property tax guide 2026. Rates by city, payment schedule, exemptions, how to appeal assessments, and OBBBA SALT cap impact. Free guide.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"property\":\"og:site_name\",\"content\":\"TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"property\":\"og:image:width\",\"content\":\"1200\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"property\":\"og:image:height\",\"content\":\"630\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"20\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment & How to Pay | TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"21\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"22\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-07-07T20:35:00.000Z\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"23\",{\"property\":\"article:modified_time\",\"content\":\"2026-07-07T20:35:00.000Z\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"24\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"25\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment & How to Pay | TheTaxCalc\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"26\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Complete Alameda County property tax guide 2026. Rates by city, payment schedule, exemptions, how to appeal assessments, and OBBBA SALT cap impact. Free guide.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"27\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"28\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"29\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/apple-touch-icon.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2e\",\"30\",{}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n3:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/49e33bee669819de.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/868a9c4503c53c54.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/d791dd6e73034ab4.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2d86c01f2aacd453.js\"],\"\"]\ne:I[45026,[\"/_next/static/chunks/49e33bee669819de.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/868a9c4503c53c54.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/d791dd6e73034ab4.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2d86c01f2aacd453.js\"],\"BlogTableOfContents\"]\n13:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/61cc43b3d7ad2990.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n14:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n2:Tb0f,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026#author\",\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rachel Mitchell\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"jobTitle\":\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director, CPA\",\"description\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026#article\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment, and How to Pay\",\"description\":\"Complete Alameda County property tax guide 2026. Rates by city, payment schedule, exemptions, how to appeal assessments, and OBBBA SALT cap impact.\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-07T20:35:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-07T20:35:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026\"},\"keywords\":[\"alameda county property tax\",\"property tax california\",\"oakland property tax\",\"alameda county tax collector\",\"prop 13\",\"property tax 2026\"],\"wordCount\":1403,\"articleSection\":\"Tax Guide\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026#breadcrumb\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment, and How to Pay\",\"item\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/alameda-county-property-tax-2026\"}]}]}0:{\"buildId\":\"DHHyHh_Ff3S5PG3AajNLG\",\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Home\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"/\"}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"]}],\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\"]}],[\"$Lc\"],\"$Ld\"]}],\"loading\":null,\"isPartial\":false}\n4:[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"hover:text-foreground transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Blog\"}]\n5:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted-foreground\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"/\"}]\n6:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"truncate text-foreground font-medium max-w-[200px] sm:max-w-none\",\"children\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment, and How to Pay\"}]\n7:[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 mb-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-500/20 dark:text-emerald-400 border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-500/30\",\"children\":\"Tax Guide\"}],false]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl leading-tight\",\"children\":\"Alameda County Property Tax 2026: Rates, Assessment, and How to Pay\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-base text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"A CPA-reviewed guide by Rachel Mitchell, CPA — updated for 2026 tax year\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Complete Alameda County property tax guide 2026. Rates by city, payment schedule, exemptions, how to appeal assessments, and OBBBA SALT cap impact.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground border-b border-border/30 pb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"By \",\"Rachel Mitchell\",\", \",\"CPA\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"time\",null,{\"dateTime\":\"2026-07-07T20:35:00.000Z\",\"children\":\"July 7, 2026\"}]}],false,[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[8,\" min read\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"alameda county property tax\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"alameda county property tax\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"property tax california\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"property tax california\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"oakland property tax\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"oakland property tax\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"alameda county tax collector\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"alameda county tax collector\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"prop 13\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"prop 13\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",\"property tax 2026\",{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-border/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":\"property tax 2026\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-5xl lg:flex lg:gap-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"aside\",null,{\"className\":\"hidden lg:block lg:w-64 lg:shrink-0\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"sticky top-24\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"entries\":[{\"id\":\"alameda-county-property-tax-rate\",\"text\":\"Alameda County Property Tax Rate\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"how-alameda-county-property-tax-is-calculated\",\"text\":\"How Alameda County Property Tax Is Calculated\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"total-effective-tax-rate-by-city\",\"text\":\"Total Effective Tax Rate by City\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"example-property-tax-on-a-900-000-home-in-oakland\",\"text\":\"Example: Property Tax on a $900,000 Home in Oakland\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"alameda-county-property-tax-payment-schedule\",\"text\":\"Alameda County Property Tax Payment Schedule\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"late-payment-penalties\",\"text\":\"Late Payment Penalties\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-to-pay-alameda-county-property-tax\",\"text\":\"How to Pay Alameda County Property Tax\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"1-online-payment\",\"text\":\"1. Online Payment\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"2-by-mail\",\"text\":\"2. By Mail\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"3-in-person\",\"text\":\"3. In Person\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"4-by-phone\",\"text\":\"4. By Phone\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"alameda-county-property-tax-exemptions\",\"text\":\"Alameda County Property Tax Exemptions\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"homeowners-exemption-prop-13\",\"text\":\"Homeowners' Exemption (Prop 13)\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"senior-exemption-prop-60-90\",\"text\":\"Senior Exemption (Prop 60/90)\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"disabled-veterans-exemption\",\"text\":\"Disabled Veterans' Exemption\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"other-exemptions\",\"text\":\"Other Exemptions\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-to-appeal-your-alameda-county-property-tax-assessment\",\"text\":\"How to Appeal Your Alameda County Property Tax Assessment\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"filing-window\",\"text\":\"Filing Window\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"steps\",\"text\":\"Steps\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"success-rate\",\"text\":\"Success Rate\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"alameda-county-property-tax-and-the-obbba-salt-cap\",\"text\":\"Alameda County Property Tax and the OBBBA SALT Cap\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"alameda-county-property-tax-revenue-use\",\"text\":\"Alameda County Property Tax Revenue Use\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"property-tax-assistance-programs\",\"text\":\"Property Tax Assistance Programs\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"property-tax-postponement-senior-disabled\",\"text\":\"Property Tax Postponement (Senior/Disabled)\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"gentry-homeowner-and-renter-assistance\",\"text\":\"Gentry Homeowner and Renter Assistance\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"frequently-asked-questions\",\"text\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"related-resources\",\"text\":\"Related Resources\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"sources\",\"text\":\"Sources\",\"level\":2}]}]}]}],\"$Lf\"]}],\"$L10\"]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"width\":48,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CPA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-500/60\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5\"}]}],\"Reviewed: January 2026\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Tax data verified against IRS Publication 15-T & state revenue departments\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\",\"children\":\"Try Our Tax Calculators\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"See exactly how much you'll take home after all taxes and deductions.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/paycheck-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Paycheck Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/illinois-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-border/50 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"IL Calculator\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/texas-tax-calculator\",\"classNa